pitch,” Cohen said this morn
ing on the way to Daytona
Beach to tackle the St. Louis
Cardinals in a return game.
“I worked and worked on ft
ever since reporting to the
Griffs at Biloxi, and now ft is
paying dividends. I think I
can stop any hitter in the coun
try with it.
“I threw screw balls to five
of them in five innings when I
had to get the side out, and it
was effective. I fooled Green
berg with it in the first inning.
